<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant bandits killed the notorious leader Kachalla Bello while the DSS uncovered guns smuggled from Niger on camels in Sokoto, and violence in northern Nigeria forced tens of thousands of civilians to flee into Niger. In Mali, a court ruled in favor of Emir Sanusi in a Fulani power struggle and jihadist groups continue to govern parts of the country. Chad forces suffered 23 soldier deaths, including a company commander, in fierce fighting over the Tibesti gold mines. Niger security forces rescued 24 kidnapping victims in Niger and Adamawa, and 64,000 Nigerians are reported to be fleeing to Niger as the conflict spreads. 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9nbXFMQ3VGb1NoQmhSRlh0dUdpU1ZGVm44MVRxZFNGODFuVmp1RjRGR2hLYzZnUWpUWWpoV0RieWpCZ0lYVXJwR1ZMTlgtOThMdmVTcUhveElmcEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQYUNSOFBBM29yd0xxcGhDN0pDSFJnMk1sNjRybzlLZVFhNjhuMDZuTjQ4Qzc1UDRWUjA0QWVkR1BpZmRtT0RxaXU2MU9yaW15Yi1oUER3a2xvVUFoN1R2dmZLbXV4VHVfamFSaVBkd0kyT25rRmlTVzhQakxvTnlkWFJWX25SZW9fS2w4bGpTcXpwOXc0RGFia1FaUkY4WnVkZE4teHBpdzQ2d1gySUxIZ2JUM0pFSlJPdW9YUTdySDNKcmdTaHdj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Africa Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNUktkYzIxUG5uazcwMUhrVjdCbTZEb211ZlM0Q3c0cmttam5meGRIZGpXSEdDT281YWtGSXgySUVTOXJnaGxIbHprVlF5aFMyNmZYblBHZGJ5cnBjbjRMUVpyX0NYcVlNblR6Y2ptQVVuejJRUEhFTmNEbWxIU1plU05mSUVhM29GM0Zu